                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-95f5e797-c49d-4266-a474-3c6ee45de6a9" type="punctum" xml:id="m-0768e571-c095-4518-9069-40e32fc566d0">
                    <nc xml:id="m-9abff5e6-dec5-4205-b485-1c1bcee76aef" pname="e" oct="3" tilt="se" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-413ce4e3-e7e7-4e46-b0d2-60a439f58bbf">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-ec9ac440-b197-4c07-8547-c79c70335a86" type="punctum" xml:id="m-d45cd74d-ae1d-4a5d-af10-8d856d206633">
                    <nc xml:id="m-014a685b-700e-47e2-8cbe-7bf8601eb12d" pname="d" oct="3" tilt="se" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-5edc8904-ae44-4c43-a0c4-1d4130232e9e">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-e31fafbe-5c5d-440e-9926-4a602476bee8" type="punctum" xml:id="m-5ca52f39-d72b-4741-957b-5b6ab477497e">
                    <nc xml:id="m-4d82bbda-c3c3-40d9-b23e-f00dbce977d4" pname="e" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-3e5af726-f1f3-4518-b2e6-7a0fc2385588">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-624e70f9-ae16-463f-bf64-18337be1aabd" type="clivis" xml:id="m-484ef6fc-7642-49d4-8b97-4f9fa907dccf">
                    <nc xml:id="m-351a43d7-9128-4732-9a3b-b18e4b2d604d" pname="e" oct="3" />
                    <nc xml:id="m-464be61f-f0f9-4f29-b470-59b272399e12" pname="d" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <divLine xml:id="m-def50438-c137-4208-9a9b-e52ecab4defc" facs="#m-e324b172-0ad7-4aea-b913-71f1683032d9" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-3a19f61b-366e-494c-bafa-bd15966cf21d">
              <lg xml:id="m-7b43cd98-117e-4426-9a44-7677e6452a7d">
                <l xml:id="m-c38661b8-001f-4777-b508-ad1f2ef2d88f" facs="#m-35a69637-23ea-47ec-bd34-aa9753ec0664" label="ambiguous">Maundy Thursday</l><l xml:id="m-84efbcea-180f-4920-8713-92cd9e1b5e42" facs="#m-32adcb01-a993-4124-aa10-a8f73d0e747e" label="ambiguous">664</l><l xml:id="m-5514cffa-de63-42c8-809d-d12539252796" facs="#m-fd2583ef-84fe-481d-b2b5-6feb3ae915c6" label="lyrics-like">Per quem majestátem tuam laudant Angeli. adórant Domina¬</l><l xml:id="m-88b8ca91-948b-4027-8006-1da4415b9025" facs="#m-3cbfa293-3660-4e98-97d3-3019b54e8a1c" label="lyrics-like">tiónes, tremunt Potestátes. Caeli, caelorúmque Virtútes, ac beáta</l><l xml:id="m-4f32944d-1dbc-4cb4-8e74-a8279dd93cd1" facs="#m-636f64e1-976e-461e-8cee-a217fbdb5c49" label="lyrics-like">Séraphim, sócia exsultatióne concélebrant. Cum quibus et nostras</l><l xml:id="m-5e65710d-93fd-4a89-bd76-58faea30ceb1" facs="#m-e3794e03-8d5d-4518-bb30-4d31737dba5f" label="lyrics-like">voces ut admitti júbeas, deprecámur, súpplici confessióne dicéntes:</l><l xml:id="m-75af5999-4350-4a01-a906-42218b20ba5e" facs="#m-e4090916-07ee-4302-b7b9-e0aa0da515d3" label="ambiguous">Sanctus, Sanctus, Sanctus...</l><l xml:id="m-5611c292-15a4-4af3-b9a4-fcb137201779" facs="#m-e7a340aa-d82c-4bac-b388-080b6b5541a4" label="lyrics-like">The Communicántes and the prayers which follow are said as in the Canon</l><l xml:id="m-53610139-ad91-4976-bd15-32e3fdb5643c" facs="#m-70ca7be5-f172-4341-8adc-89a987d72677" label="text-like">of the Mass without any additions or alterations.</l><l xml:id="m-b9390fce-d0aa-4190-ae78-123ac23195ed" facs="#m-66ed560c-d089-4df9-9f0c-b9925f9e8d51" label="text-like">Towards the end of the Preface, which is sung, in accordance vith the</l><l xml:id="m-c4330625-b79d-4d67-b8c5-6ab1a3292322" facs="#m-55c3a361-bbdd-4762-948d-b8c98f20452d" label="lyrics-like">Pontifical, over the Chrism to be consecrated, the vords from "ut spirituális</l><l xml:id="m-752a12f7-422d-46a8-b9a4-3a8a8320adf9" facs="#m-a416f021-f7e9-404e-bed1-17fdf29569e0" label="lyrics-like">lavácri baptismatis " until "“vestiménto incorrúpti múneris induántur</l><l xml:id="m-24c0c85b-cae6-48d1-a8c0-008ee20df25e" facs="#m-0950ffb1-d144-44bf-a840-5924823e7be0" label="text-like">are omitted. These words were formerly part of the proper Preface for</l><l xml:id="m-192b1382-97ec-40f9-8a0f-1ae34fd63f20" facs="#m-280606a6-22de-40f5-9e17-361726d58a9c" label="text-like">consecrating the Chrism, but they have nou been restored io their place in</l><l xml:id="m-6211aba6-b48b-43dd-885d-ecf800fd8c17" facs="#m-4b89f03a-bbbb-4f65-a454-cf1c8a0df206" label="text-like">the Preface of the Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-3fee67d5-e67f-4771-9d6f-7265dd03bcaa" facs="#m-ea5752d0-8fd3-4779-95de-eaf58d2d9425" label="lyrics-like">At each of the three invocations of the Agnus Déi, the ansver is miserére</l><l xml:id="m-70907f7f-cc77-4e62-9902-ac3f17696173" facs="#m-2f9aa27a-21e5-4dc0-b831-ea228e71e465" label="lyrics-like">nóbis. The hiss of peace and the prayer Dómine Jesu Christe, qui dixisti</l><l xml:id="m-582323a0-98e6-4fab-bf71-7333d67265a8" facs="#m-2f094263-f338-4b63-a319-c81e8e6d4b6b" label="ambiguous">are omitted to-day.</l><l xml:id="m-ac28885f-87d4-4509-a132-b060929db8b5" facs="#m-ba1f049e-6cd3-4193-ab57-ef1c96e55ee7" label="text-like">The distribution of Holy Communion is not allowed at this Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-724e5797-4ff3-42ab-ade4-9db2be2dff69" facs="#m-ebe8e4eb-10b2-4df2-a500-97ba7b814086" label="text-like">After the Commuion the bishop performs the ablutions in the usual way,</l><l xml:id="m-2bcb3fcc-a070-4c34-8d8d-5d801e4710de" facs="#m-a7a87cca-30de-4bd3-bf4f-f8e7478e7898" label="text-like">even if he is going to sinɇ the solemn evening Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-e3a64d89-bf1f-4c5f-a4ac-0236c998910c" facs="#m-069cbe8f-2ed7-414f-8c12-388e19bc814a" label="text-like">COMMUNION ANTIPHON</l><l xml:id="m-b7446beb-63d4-43c3-99bd-7d72883bab69" facs="#m-a0c39e45-2b72-4fc3-ae10-c1fee646a1d7" label="lyrics-like">Raedi-cábant Apósto¬ li</l><l xml:id="m-8f2778c0-56b1-4e66-a7fc-2ae7ce6d6d3d" facs="#m-cfd3408e-d119-4473-87dc-7a76dc2d05c7" label="lyrics-like">ut paeni-ténti¬ am</l><l xml:id="m-73ba08d6-a639-400b-9026-155ccfcbd661" facs="#m-0605a54f-dcdb-4753-9791-5873f5731ad2" label="lyrics-like">á-ge-rent, et ungébant ó-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-0aac4598-6c71-4f24-9436-058ca75ae946" facs="#m-0a51eb70-b8d3-428f-b93e-4045e48f47d5" label="lyrics-like">múl-tos aé¬</l><l xml:id="m-b7ab56cf-eef1-4e44-8cbf-1147bc67f2c8" facs="#m-1036508b-5c74-43f2-9d66-8570fd89f600" label="ambiguous">gros,</l><l xml:id="m-0c2a0a01-1a8e-4f2f-8e5c-cc6fe1d84280" facs="#m-6d1504b0-7164-49c0-a05a-fda07030ccc0" label="lyrics-like">et sa¬ ná¬ bant.</l><l xml:id="m-b0a3e3df-9f53-432a-8ed7-c8b356e2b124" facs="#m-cd0b2f10-7957-478c-8b62-4ca8e59b37f8" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-5711097d-ec5f-40fe-96b2-2b28d9c77a3a" facs="#m-fe458a8e-e606-4531-968f-9491ad06bc98" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion</l><l xml:id="m-6593ad05-2b47-4928-983a-2b24b6abc563" facs="#m-589bb152-4e5c-43c4-968d-22a658af73ff" label="lyrics-like">ORaesta, quaésumus, Dómine: depósita, sanctificátis méntibus</l><l xml:id="m-73dbdd16-8896-4936-ac3f-08a4e7e1078f" facs="#m-a13c7735-9f08-4c57-9360-dc347fd0d646" label="lyrics-like">Lut, sicut de praetéritis ad innovémur. Per Dóminum nos¬</l><l xml:id="m-04285fc1-e4d6-400f-898e-7f9a0bfd5308" facs="#m-5311a00c-7dcb-4622-af97-632fe79b30ba" label="lyrics-like">nova transímus; ita, vetustáte trum Jesum Christum.</l><l xml:id="m-b93fb3bd-1255-41c0-bcb8-ec5711f07027" facs="#m-327c198d-ebf3-4cbb-a0c8-f4f4e626e034" label="text-like">The blessine is given, p. 111, and indulgences published. The last Gospel</l><l xml:id="m-f5fdf017-66d7-4541-95c0-095264fb92a3" facs="#m-b39a238d-42f4-4907-9efe-bb63c6d2773a" label="text-like">is omitted; and all return in procession to the sacristy.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>